---
// Film grain overlay - static texture.
//
// This used to animate the layer with a stepped transform. Measured while
// scrolling, that animation halved the frame rate (33-50ms frames against 17ms
// without it): a full-viewport composited layer invalidating on every step
// competes with the compositor during scroll, for a shimmer that is barely
// visible at 7% opacity.
---

<div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .grain {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9999;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.07;
    background-image: url('/images/grain.webp');
    background-repeat: repeat;
    background-size: 128px 128px;
  }
</style>
